[{"title":"送新四川茶马","author":"度正","text":"庆元二年春，有诏来自东。\n曰东川漕臣，忧国尽变通。\n东川十五郡，连年岁不丰。\n国计仅以足，民力几穷空。\n赖兹经纶手，调护遂奏功。\n曰维榷牧司，有言惊圣聪。\n咨尔予漕臣，佥言尔惟忠。\n往哉其抚事，惟和惟其中。\n蜀人闻天书，喜气如春风。\n窃思斟酌权，大概不可穷。\n在昔元祐间，委付失狂童。\n苞苴肆分行，锥刀到心胸。\n小苏抗章论，大苏以诗攻。\n至今百世下，得失烂如烘。\n明公冰霜姿，材业尤雄雄。\n剸割一指间，妙用付天工。\n鸟兽虽无知，好恶人则同。\n觌德自来驯，遇暴辄兴戎。\n从兹三边人，稽首不敢凶。\n蜀人愿公留，天子将思公。\n谓公曰还归，其以来年冬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食笋","author":"度正","text":"早笋自香美，欲食不得尝。\n晚笋已恶臭，顿顿充庖浆。\n蔬食苦不继，且复几其良。\n陋巷有佳人，箪瓢不充肠。\n其人久已死，至今有耿光。\n所以天下士，贫者惟其常。\n得失固了然，是非何较量。\n大烹幸列鼎，嗟尔其勉强。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"校书西衙枕上呈刘原朝","author":"度正","text":"夜雨不肯晓，拥衾独长叹。\n借问叹何为，嘿嘿终无言。\n回风起相薄，万物无欢颜。\n我心如古人，作诗歌岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成奉寄思中索酒","author":"度正","text":"雨中风味似太苦，梦里秋怀如乱麻。\n赖有郎君自轩豁，时携一酌过西衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄襄阳杨侍郎三丈","author":"度正","text":"茫茫天地间，万象森纷罗。\n乃眷蜀三川，神气尤雄豪。\n一川发于岷，一川分于洮。\n一川启母来，其名为江沱。\n洮江得三陈，经纶参夔皋。\n协心裨兴运，庙社遗勋劳。\n岷江得两苏，议论丘与轲。\n只今元祐碑，辉华万丈高。\n沱江当其中，瀰漫而委佗。\n中兴得五杨，其三真英髦。\n绵州号魁磊，射策登巍科。\n嘉谟荐入告，旋进旋蹉跎。\n南部最逸才，气欲星斗摩。\n遗墨数千言，往往皆离骚。\n惜哉天下士，中道迷山阿。\n三丈宽宇量，中立而不它。\n事业照锦屏，文章烂岷峨。\n缩手不近前，三年淹礼曹。\n翻然念乡舍，屡乞分旌旄。\n天子勉从之，出镇姑养痾。\n荆南古都会，十万雄干戈。\n闭阁阅诗书，人物如春和。\n襄阳控敌冲，铁骑连两河。\n抚之以仁义，敌人不敢过。\n如闻九天上，屡欲书归禾。\n生人政云霓，如何久婆娑。\n一嘿了万事，明哲中自韬。\n造次颠沛间，超然完所操。\n缙绅岂不愿，广厦陪赓歌。\n吹嘘元气回，汇征如拔茅。\n正生沱江滨，饮啄同一波。\n辛勤事学问，如琢磨切磋。\n大不遗泰山，小不遗秋毫。\n古今靡不该，上下靡不包。\n动静极根源，万物无所逃。\n中心如金石，困折亦已多。\n常忧辱此江，而为江神呵。\n行李弥域中，皇皇莫一遭。\n扁舟复东来，欲见空神交。\n引领写胸臆，清风送洪涛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"笼鸡","author":"度正","text":"笼中畜一鸡，饮啄颇云足。\n其鸡浑不顾，引颈欲逃出。\n旁鸡大爱之，贪食笼中食。\n回旋欲归笼，不省笼拘束。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒江州易彦章","author":"度正","text":"经帷谏阁竟云何，且著莲花峰下么。\n书院凄凉安处问，庐山突兀为谁高。\n依依松柏经年好，泛泛莺花逐日过。\n万世清芬悬日月，元来得失一毫毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋张袁州隐斋三首 其三","author":"度正","text":"杀麑无戚容，活蚁有德色。\n不如未见蚁，生道犹不息。\n心如隔窗月，光不见微隙。\n不患无发时，却患发无益。\n一矜障万善，千悔无一得。\n要加持养功，跬步见天则。\n宇宙渺无穷，此道足充塞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋张袁州隐斋三首 其二","author":"度正","text":"少时见敲搒，濈濈背欲汗。\n及壮事州县，稍稍觉不惮。\n由来祇一心，今昔非异见。\n君子远庖厨，夫岂恶刍豢。\n长恐恶念熟，此道出无间。\n是隐乃在我，扁榜安用办。\n君侯退归来，此意却无限。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋张袁州隐斋三首 其一","author":"度正","text":"齐王非爱牛，厉人非爱子。\n秉彝未殄灭，生意不可已。\n傥能克其端，万物均一体。\n胡为隔形骸，强自分彼此。\n达人有大观，俯仰尽天理。\n从渠美与恶，不与我愠喜。\n敬问何以然，请先事克己。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38626,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送茶使赵伯川赴阙","author":"度正","text":"三王垂世何煌煌，诗书所称周尤长。\n虽云积累日源远，其实本支由宗彊。\n内环旦奭扶九陆，外列毛原镇四方。\n宣王中兴恢大业，复有虎臣如鹰扬。\n卜年过历前未有，邈哉夏商矧汉唐。\n皇家揖逊古舜禹，建宗作屏周成康。\n巍乎神庙有遗训，作而新之进厥良。\n振振信厚皆麟趾，翙翙羽仪多凤凰。\n扶持天日岂易事，往岁一段尤辉光。\n无何谗口乱白黑，至欲疏远空藩墙。\n天相宗社迄感悟，重惟孤立当惩创。\n有伟丈夫在远外，是尝拒贼贼莫伤。\n渊洪胸次自磊磊，慷慨颜貌真堂堂。\n吾君想象日已久，急下诏书来取将。\n旁招俊乂第一义，理乱之机戒履霜。\n名世之卿夫岂少，贵戚之卿人所望。\n有怀器业得施用，感激为赋维城章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38627,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漕司檄劝稼望见资州忆王褒李鼎祚 其一","author":"度正","text":"文王既没易中没，孔子重明汉又衰。\n可惜李生真力学，但求象数不求词。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38628,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复挽","author":"施士衡","text":"十年帅钺倦驰驱，适意方谋一壑居。\n贾谊有才终太傅，薛收无寿处中书。\n伤心风月江心古，过眼光阴梦幻虚。\n红紫飘零春色尽，后凋松柏独萧疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38629,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽于湖","author":"施士衡","text":"涌泉词笔坐中惊，天付斯文以道鸣。\n独步蟾宫丹桂选，濡毫纶阁紫微清。\n绝弦恸哭人琴丧，埋玉凄凉柱石倾。\n一见那知成永别，重来天路问骑鲸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38630,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"施元长","text":"我观招提境，古桧何苍奇。\n白蚁巢其根，青虬啮其枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38631,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"施元长","text":"寖历岁年久，靡受霜雪欺。\n落落梁栋材，矫矫松柏姿。\n明当构廊庙，匠石良汝资。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38632,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山","author":"施冘","text":"苍虬横距沙心泊，蜿蜒跨山矗一角。\n松林忽撼洪涛风，雪浪排空奔电雹。\n长淮渺渺烟未收，英雄自老江自流。\n野人半醉不一语，豁见秋月升山头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38633,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金陵作","author":"施文煜","text":"紫盖东南久寂寥，石城烟雾压岧峣。\n登台倦客怀千古，宿内闲人梦六朝。\n御苑云浮曾拾翠，旧楼月落尚吹箫。\n诸公不说新亭事，目断空江半日潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38634,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟","author":"施岳","text":"翠鳌涌出沧溟，影横栈壁迷烟墅。\n楼台对起，阑干重凭，山川自古。\n梁苑平芜，汴堤疏柳，几番晴雨。\n看天低四远，江空万里，登临处、分吴楚。\n两岸花飞絮舞。\n度春风、满城箫鼓。\n英雄暗老，昏潮晓汐，归帆过舻。\n淮水东流，塞云北渡，夕阳西去。\n正凄凉望极，中原路杳，月来南浦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38635,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兰陵王","author":"施岳","text":"柳花白。\n飞入青烟巷陌。\n凭高处，愁锁断桥，十里东风正无力。\n西湖路咫尺。\n犹阻仙源信息。\n伤心事，还似去年，中酒恹恹度寒食。\n闲窗掩春寂。\n但粉指留红，茸唾凝碧。\n歌尘不散蒙香泽。\n念鸾孤金镜，雁空瑶瑟。\n芳时凉夜尽怨忆。\n梦魂省难觅。\n鳞鸿，渺踪迹。\n纵罗帕亲题，锦字谁织。\n缄情欲寄重城隔。\n又流水斜照，倦箫残笛。\n楼台相望，对暮色，恨无极。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38636,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曲游春 清明湖上","author":"施岳","text":"画舸西泠路，占柳阴花影，芳意如织。\n小楫冲波，度曲尘扇底，粉香帘隙。\n岸转斜阳隔。\n又过尽、别船箫笛。\n傍断桥、翠绕红围，相对半篙晴色。\n顷刻。\n千山暮碧。\n向沽酒楼前，犹系金勒。\n乘月归来，正梨花夜缟，海棠烟幂。\n院宇明寒食。\n醉乍醒、一庭春寂。\n任满身、露湿东风，欲眠未得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38637,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"步月 茉莉","author":"施岳","text":"玉宇薰风，宝阶明月，翠丛万点晴雪。\n炼霜不就，散广寒霏屑。\n采珠蓓、绿萼露滋，嗔银艳、小莲冰洁。\n花痕在，纤指嫩痕，素英重结。\n枝头香未绝。\n还是过中秋，丹桂时节。\n醉乡冷境，怕翻成悄歇。\n玩芳味、春焙旋熏。\n贮秾韵、水沉频爇。\n堪怜处，输与夜凉睡蝶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38638,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐","author":"施岳","text":"水遥花瞑。\n隔岸炊烟冷。\n十里垂杨摇嫩影。\n宿酒和愁都醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38639,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解语花","author":"施岳","text":"云容冱雪，暮色添寒，楼台共临眺。\n翠丛深窅。\n无人处、数蕊弄春犹小。\n幽姿谩好。\n遥相望、含情一笑。\n花解语，因甚无言，心事应难表。\n莫待墙阴暗老。\n称琴边月夜，笛里霜晓。\n护香须早。\n东风度、咫尺画阑琼沼。\n归来梦绕。\n歌云坠、依然惊觉。\n想恁时，小几银屏冷未了。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38640,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题会稽溪口躬师上人房","author":"施昌言","text":"溪口佳山水，高人住此中。\n生台下沙鸟，疏磬逐江风。\n倚槛千岩寂，焚香万法空。\n如何凭小笔，一为写衰翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38641,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞","author":"施枢","text":"玄盖天中万象垂，洞门无钥许人窥。\n仙踪直与华阳接，能继玄同有阿谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38642,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小琼花","author":"施枢","text":"合是孤根在广庭，世间那得此云英。\n霓裳一曲天香散，惆怅瑶阶月自明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38643,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小楼对月","author":"施枢","text":"京国谁曾念旅游，闲情芳思两悠悠。\n却因今夜栏干月，引得春风上小楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38644,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小楼独坐用菊潭壁间韵","author":"施枢","text":"帘捲疏风入小楼，夕阳衔雁欲西流。\n无人细说吟边事，独有黄花共晚秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38645,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"飞玉亭","author":"施枢","text":"素练飞来衮雪毬，满怀风露不胜秋。\n翠蛟已是天然景，今日还当避一头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38646,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事","author":"施枢","text":"闲时但觉求人易，险处方知为己深。\n世事尽随流水去，白云自识古人心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38647,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云根石","author":"施枢","text":"溶溶聚散霎时间，岂有根株在世凡。\n料是从龙归洞穴，故应化作此巉岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分韵春字","author":"施枢","text":"柳外莺声错唤人，小楼吟苦不知春。\n落花飞过秋千去，一片闲情客里身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午寝","author":"施枢","text":"旧诗零乱满藤床，绿映帘深一缕香。\n午梦惊回槐国远，浮生消得几斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天柱峰","author":"施枢","text":"擎天一柱锁崖嵬，六洞烟云亦异哉。\n更有泉飞漱寒玉，不妨频为此山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无骨箬","author":"施枢","text":"功成归去作飞仙，箬下遗丹不浪传。\n千载岂皆无遇者，要须种植验前缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜忆梅花","author":"施枢","text":"夜深寒月照窗纱，忽忆林逋处士家。\n鸥鹭正眠烟树冷，不知谁可伴梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"施枢","text":"欲荒三径负归期，魂梦何曾到短篱。\n九辩不歌陶令老，清香还许入谁诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉蝴蝶花","author":"施枢","text":"芳意深深掩绿苔，粉团香翅自裴回。\n多应又怨春归早，化作飞花满树开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生公讲台","author":"施枢","text":"千人凑座雨天花，片石虽顽识当家。\n万境俱空非有相，漫留尘迹与人誇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生朝报恩夜醮","author":"施枢","text":"绛节翩翩七宝车，谣歌飞上玉皇家。\n鹤坛月冷天风静，开尽碧桃无限花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石桥接待 其二","author":"施枢","text":"手笔华严梵笈新，更开宝地接迷津。\n一声金磬人初静，月照空山草自春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石桥接待 其一","author":"施枢","text":"当年立雪直齐腰，宗旨流传到石桥。\n风急窗寒灯影远，疏梅无语夜芗销。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春","author":"施枢","text":"彩胜飘春上鬓蓬，倚栏一笑问东风。\n青青柳眼梅花面，才染阳和便不同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙瑞宫侧访仙姑不值","author":"施枢","text":"轻红片片落桃花，刘阮空迎紫凤车。\n石洞有天元不闭，何须流水觅胡麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲孚岁晚书怀因次其韵","author":"施枢","text":"终有徵书访绮园，心期独向老天言。\n物情已逐东风转，未必全归野烧痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再观钱庙","author":"施枢","text":"荒碑五丈藓生花，飞鼠巢梁壁缀蜗。\n华胄遥遥天下满，不知誓券落谁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后坞示壁天瑞","author":"施枢","text":"几年不到巳公斋，客里明知未定家。\n生灭无边方共语，满山春雨落松花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早起","author":"施枢","text":"檐前鸣玉响丁东，清梦初回鹤帐中。\n早起井梧飘一叶，方知昨夜是秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西河柳","author":"施枢","text":"一把轻丝拂地垂，柔梢浅浅抹燕脂。\n絮花吹尽枝方长，却恨春风未得知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初泊世綵","author":"施枢","text":"不问萧条传舍空，来攲客枕听西风。\n一庭明月无人筦，秋在梧桐落叶中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"施枢","text":"暝色分烟上远峰，雨声断处又晴风。\n宝香羞冷闲情远，落尽蔷薇一架红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛月夜归","author":"施枢","text":"短艇冲寒泛浅沙，满溪明月浸芦花。\n忽惊远岸灯光发，篱落萧疏一两家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟溪市桥见月","author":"施枢","text":"楼台叠翠绕清溪，浅澹云边月一眉。\n行到市声相接处，傍桥灯火未多时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38670,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和菊潭玉泉韵","author":"施枢","text":"不是灵源透碧虚，可容六六化龙鱼。\n讲经人去前湖暝，翻手为霖自有馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38671,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜泊黄湾","author":"施枢","text":"移近黄湾泊短篷，野云垂地一溪风。\n渚香吹散荷花雨，几点流萤出苇丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38672,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜闻城中箫鼓","author":"施枢","text":"箫鼓喧天竞看灯，都民应喜见升平。\n芳心自不同年少，细嚼梅花坐月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38673,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜凉听雨","author":"施枢","text":"暑雨沉沉夜正深，凉欺客枕梦频醒。\n虽然未是秋时候，滴在梧桐亦厌听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38674,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"所见","author":"施枢","text":"齐眉沉醉绮罗丛，心事谁知付去鸿。\n不惜千金留粉黛，更无一语怨东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38675,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"轮差祝圣所拈香 其二","author":"施枢","text":"几度来游几赋诗，又因将命到灵芝。\n三呼祝了君王寿，偷眼湖光立片时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38676,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"轮差祝圣所拈香 其一","author":"施枢","text":"瓣芗来谒玉晨宫，月在觚棱绛阙东。\n转向御街西畔过，朝天万马正匆匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38677,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑池","author":"施枢","text":"雨壁烟崖翠藓长，龙泓冷浸斗牛光。\n独怜有水清无底，不洗花池粉腻香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38678,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客中雨思","author":"施枢","text":"细雨粘云结晚愁，黄金垂地菊钱流。\n风来不觉窗声战，分却羁怀一半秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38679,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春夜赋小字","author":"施枢","text":"岸桐花开春欲老，目断斜阳芳信杳。\n东风不筦客情多，杜鹃啼月青山小。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38680,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夜即事","author":"施枢","text":"断雨寒云过暝窗，落桐叶叶是凄凉。\n楚山不入清宵梦，月影蛩声满桂芗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38681,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺思","author":"施枢","text":"帘底临鸾惜岁华，鬓云慵掠宝钗斜。\n落梅香断无消息，一树春风属杏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38682,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]